# This repo is edited on Windows and parts of it run on a Raspberry Pi. A
# shell script checked out with CRLF line endings fails on the first line
# with "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter", which is a confusing half-hour — so
# everything that gets copied to the hub is kept LF whatever the platform.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.service       text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.sql           text eol=lf
